<BaseLayout title="About">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p>Before I ever wrote code, I wanted to play football for my county. That didn’t happen, so I picked the other thing I’d loved since school — computers, because they’re logical: they do exactly what you tell them, or show you exactly where you went wrong. Now I build backend systems for a living. The part of me that wanted the pitch never left, though. It just found other ways out — which is what most of this site is: poems, stories, and the things I build along the way.</p>
</BaseLayout>
